    "slot_value": "Comparison should mainly depend on whether records come from the same source or study context and whether they have enough complete fields to make the comparison meaningful. Records flagged as out-of-scope or non-verified should generally not be compared unless the user explicitly overrides that, and the system should prevent obviously mismatched records from being compared by default. Comparison of a few points side by side should be allowed when it helps analysis, but it should be limited if the dataset is too large for reliable comparison.",
